    (9, None, '\'Maybe we will name him Zhenya?\' "Zhenya" is short for both Evgeny and Evgeniya, so it fits a boy or a girl. "Nazovyom" is "we will name", the verb in Barinov\'s "Nazovi tochnuyu tsenu". "Mozhet" is "maybe".'),
